WEBVTT

00:08:59.871 --> 00:09:03.246
You know, I think that in a world,
especially over the last, let's say, 20,

00:09:03.246 --> 00:09:07.912
25 years or the amount of information that
we're expected to sort of keep in

00:09:07.912 --> 00:09:12.329
our brain and the analytics that we have
to do on a daily basis to do our job

00:09:12.329 --> 00:09:14.746
and to process the world and to
interact with other people,

00:09:15.246 --> 00:09:19.787
we are inclined to create these rustics
that we just take for granted.

00:09:20.204 --> 00:09:23.871
And a lot of those critics are deeply,
deeply, deeply flawed.

00:09:24.079 --> 00:09:28.037
And we as individuals and as
organizations have to do

00:09:28.037 --> 00:09:31.579
a better job of aggressively interrogating
them both for the good of